    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別に、お前らに
信じてもらいてぇなんて
思わねぇけどよぉ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not that I really expect ya to believe me, anyways.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの&lt;Beryl&gt;って
へそ曲がり、放っておいたら
何するかわからねぇぜぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That &lt;Beryl&gt;'s a real loose cannon that one. Who knows what she'll do if I just leave her be.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もうけ話ならいつでも歓迎だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm always open to hearin' money making schemes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美人の持ってくる
もうけ話なら大歓迎だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bonus points if it's comin' from a pretty lady!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>がはははっ！
一緒に幸せになろうぜぇ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gahaha! Let's party! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あの事はナ・イ・ショだぜぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But that's our little secret, got that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あの事はヒ・ミ・ツだぜぇ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>がはははっ！
なんだか俺たち
アヤシイ関係みてぇだなぁ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gahaha! Suspicious, are we? ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やれやれ、こんな大ピンチは
カンベンしてくれよなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just great, seems you've caught me in quite the pickle...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>年がいもなく
闘志がわいてきちまって
恥ずかしいからよォ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My fighting spirit's burnin' up, but alas... These old bones just don't work like they used to!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
