    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>護衛をひきうけていただけないなら
しかたありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Employing an guard will simply not suffice, so we were left with no other option.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結晶騎士か帝国軍に
&lt;Beryl&gt;の逮捕を
依頼するしかありませんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We are left with no choice but to seek aid of a Crystal Knight or the Imperial Army to arrest &lt;Beryl&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェン商会への商用は
すべて私を通していただきます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Every transaction the Chen Corporation is involved with goes past me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェン大人は、感覚的で
大雑把すぎますから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Papa Chen is a very sensible man, if a bit rough around the edges.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大人が、こうまで肩入れするのは
とてもレアなケースです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is quite a rare sight for Papa to leave so much in other's hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……こんなに素で嬉しそうな
大人の笑顔も非常にレアです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Seeing Papa smile so genuinely is quite the rarity.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最も効率的かつ安全であると
想定される輸送計画書を
作成しました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We have organized a transportation plan we believe is the most safe and efficient way.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>救援物資の配送効率が
３０％アップするはずです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Efficiency of of relief supply delivery should see a thirty percent increase.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>各地への救援物資の配送は
チェン商会……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Chen Corporation is responsible for the delivery of relief supplies across the world...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>32852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ、この秘書エカイユに
お任せください∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, you can trust me to take of this personally. ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
